## Docker ##
# Not the whole directory: docker/compose.yml is tracked, and git cannot re-include a file
# whose parent directory is excluded, so an ignored `docker/` would silently swallow every
# file added beside it -- absent from `git status` and from a fresh clone.
docker/data/
docker/*.env
!docker/*.env.example
# Compose would not read it from here, but nobody should be able to commit one by accident.
/.env
/.micronaut/test-resources/test-resources-port.txt
